committer NeverSightAI <neversightai@gmail.com> 1794940523 +0800

X86: project EVEX transfer IDs and extents through scan plans

Extend the generated opcode index to ordinary unmasked packed moves and
full-tuple broadcasts. Canonical probes own public IDs, width selection,
and validation across register and address fields. A ModR/M extent table
handles ordinary addressing, reading the SIB base only when needed.
Keep adapter precedence and the existing fallback for unadmitted forms.
